            },
            {
              "content": "=Generate ONE highly-optimized, 2026-style Google search query to find the most recent 'Social Hooks' and 'Operational Updates' for {{ $json.company }}.\n\nThe goal is to find what the company or its founders are *actually saying* right now, not just news reports.\n\nQuery Requirements:\n- Target multiple platforms in one go: (site:linkedin.com/posts OR site:x.com OR site:twitter.com OR site:facebook.com OR site:instagram.com).\n- Look for keywords like: (announced OR \"we are hiring\" OR \"launching\" OR \"our take on\" OR \"excited to share\").\n- Include the company name: {{ $json.company }}.\n\nmostly look for recent announcements\n\nRules:\n- Output MUST be a single line Google search query.\n- Use boolean operators (OR, site:) to maximize credit efficiency.\n- Return ONLY the query text.\n\nneed as proper SERP search Queries"
